{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the hidden pages of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> comes a visual novel where the boundary between the living and the unseen begins to blur. Step into Jurnal Risa's world where each shadow holds a story, and every whisper leads you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the resurrection of the foretold nemesis of the <i>Jurnal Risa</i> crew, which was never revealed before. Unveil its dark destiny within this horror-adventure game. This is the tale of <i>Jurnal Risa</i>, as recounted to me by Risa herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of <i>Jurnal Risa</i>, as recounted to me by Risa herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Paranormal Adventure Mystery</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.poster.avif?t=1765265539\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.webm?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/352c5aedf83117d168a6a4aca5628628.mp4?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jurnal Risa is known for exploring haunted places and sharing true ghost stories from Indonesia. Their adventures, bonds, and spiritual encounters inspire the game\u2019s mystery and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brought to Life with Full Voice Acting</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/d99d1c53cb70de4c3f807412a2c8a33b.poster.avif?t=1765265539\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/d99d1c53cb70de4c3f807412a2c8a33b.webm?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/d99d1c53cb70de4c3f807412a2c8a33b.mp4?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by the real members of the group, each scene feels authentic as it captures their unique personalities, real-life bonds, and the emotional weight behind every supernatural encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini games</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/b40d9cadd140474d0b4457d6be42cf04.poster.avif?t=1765265539\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/b40d9cadd140474d0b4457d6be42cf04.webm?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/b40d9cadd140474d0b4457d6be42cf04.mp4?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the tension with fun mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the Fragments of the Past</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.poster.avif?t=1765265539\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.webm?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.mp4?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectible photos as you complete stories and challenges. Each photo unlocks a memory or reveals a hidden piece of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to turn the last page and face what lingers beyond?</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Foreshadowing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/832c11e064fed8b6226205d06dc9fb26cd8cfe28.jpg"},{"name":"Family legacy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/78faab7833708dbe0525d9e5d5e5235b0bc177e7.jpg"},{"name":"The Medium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/6620201dfd1fae242eb4224e2b0c1dde8942e5f4.jpg"},{"name":"Family absolution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/8dd0af43ed71fd7ba557aea4752a77b03009cb4b.jpg"},{"name":"Family absolution?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/2b0edb0414f7df190b8ec59b1852ad77e608788e.jpg"},{"name":"Family matters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/1d6aea936b5330160fc86c83b3f07f8f2be90886.jpg"},{"name":"Need a helmet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/20a05c492ba66f9b73fbabf55681a46e198fadf0.jpg"},{"name":"Lousy drawing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417470/27c1e9a6b0673651f066a9f78be616d580